{"seq":1,"slug":"recruit-outreach-workflow","title":"招募建联工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/outreach-brief-contract/recruit-outreach-workflow","wordCount":2342,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"招募建联工作流\">招募建联工作流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>候选名单交到运营手上，第一个动作是「联系达人」。绝大多数人把这一步想成「发一封邮件」，实际上它是一个多轮、多渠道、有冷却期和频次上限的<strong>状态机</strong>。把它当邮件看待会导致三类可预见的事故：同一个达人被三个运营同时联系（撞单）、被拒绝的达人一周后又收到一模一样的私信（骚扰）、报价在未经确认的情况下被自动发出（越权承诺）。</p>\n<p>招募建联工作流要解决的正是这些。它把「接触一个达人」建模为一条有明确状态、明确谁可以推进、明确超时行为的状态流转，并且把「对外发送」这个不可撤回的动作置于显式的闸门之后。</p>\n<p>这条流程的输入来自第 1 章：<a href=\"../creator-discovery-profile/creator-tier-fraud-signal\">达人分层与水军/刷量信号</a> 产出的低风险候选集，按契合度与单位成本排序。输出是一条处于 <code>negotiating</code> 的招募记录，交给第 2 篇 <a href=\"sample-seeding-contract\">寄样与合同/合规条款</a> 固化为契约。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; queued&#10;  queued --&gt; contacted: 首次触达(人工确认)&#10;  contacted --&gt; replied: 达人回复&#10;  contacted --&gt; no_response: 超时 7 天&#10;  no_response --&gt; followup: 第 2 轮(冷却后)&#10;  followup --&gt; replied: 回复&#10;  followup --&gt; closed_lost: 无回复或明确拒绝&#10;  replied --&gt; negotiating: 进入条件谈判&#10;  negotiating --&gt; agreement_pending: 双方条款一致&#10;  negotiating --&gt; closed_lost: 谈崩/超预算&#10;  agreement_pending --&gt; contracted: 合同签署&#10;  closed_lost --&gt; [*]&#10;  contracted --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; queued\n  queued --&gt; contacted: 首次触达(人工确认)\n  contacted --&gt; replied: 达人回复\n  contacted --&gt; no_response: 超时 7 天\n  no_response --&gt; followup: 第 2 轮(冷却后)\n  followup --&gt; replied: 回复\n  followup --&gt; closed_lost: 无回复或明确拒绝\n  replied --&gt; negotiating: 进入条件谈判\n  negotiating --&gt; agreement_pending: 双方条款一致\n  negotiating --&gt; closed_lost: 谈崩/超预算\n  agreement_pending --&gt; contracted: 合同签署\n  closed_lost --&gt; [*]\n  contracted --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"触达渠道与频次治理\">触达渠道与频次治理</h2><h3 id=\"渠道选择与优先级\">渠道选择与优先级</h3><p>达人可触达的渠道有多条，可靠性和「打扰成本」各不相同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>典型送达率</th>\n<th>打扰成本</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台站内私信</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>首触与跟进（平台内建渠道）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商务邮箱</td>\n<td>中（易进垃圾箱）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>正式谈判、合同往来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经纪人/MCN 对接</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>头部达人与机构签约达人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台官方邀约后台</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>已入驻平台的达人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>优先级不是固定的。头部达人通常由 MCN 代理，直接私信往往无效；微型达人通常亲自看私信，走邮箱反而慢。因此系统应当把「达人类型」与「首选渠道」的映射做成配置，而不是硬编码。</p>\n<p>走邮箱渠道时还有一层法律约束：商业邮件受各地反垃圾邮件法规约束。以美国为例，<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business\">FTC 的 CAN-SPAM 合规指南</a>要求邮件头信息真实、主题行不欺骗、<strong>清晰显著地标明这是广告</strong>、包含有效的实体邮寄地址、提供清晰的退订机制，并在收到退订请求后 <strong>10 个工作日内</strong>执行（退订通道须在发送后至少 30 天内有效）；每封违规邮件最高可罚 53,088 美元（金额随通胀调整）。这直接决定了本系统必须做两件工程事：把邮件模板的「广告标识 + 实体地址 + 退订链接」做成发送前的必填校验，以及把退订请求接进频次治理的静默期——退订的效果比「明确拒绝」更强，应当是<strong>永久</strong>退订（该渠道）而非 6 个月。</p>\n<h3 id=\"频次上限与冷却期\">频次上限与冷却期</h3><p>频次治理是防骚扰的核心机制，必须落在<strong>服务端强制</strong>而不是靠运营自觉。三条规定是常见基线：同一达人在任意 30 天内被同一品牌触达不超过 3 次；两次触达之间至少间隔 72 小时（冷却期）；明确拒绝后的达人进入 6 个月的静默期。</p>\n<p>一个容易忽略的边界是<strong>跨品牌/跨团队的去重</strong>。同一集团下不同子品牌可能各自建联同一个达人，从集团视角这仍是骚扰。因此频率计数应当以「达人 + 集团/租户」为作用域，而非「达人 + 单个营销项目」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE outreach_attempt (&#10;  attempt_id    BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;  creator_id    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  tenant_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  campaign_id   BIGINT,&#10;  channel       VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- dm | email | agency | marketplace&#10;  direction     VARCHAR(8)  NOT NULL,   -- out | in&#10;  template_id   BIGINT,&#10;  status        VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- sent | delivered | bounced&#10;  sent_at       TIMESTAMP   NOT NULL,&#10;  sent_by       BIGINT,                 -- operator user id; NULL=automation&#10;  KEY idx_freq (tenant_id, creator_id, sent_at),&#10;  KEY idx_campaign (campaign_id)&#10;) COMMENT &#39;触达流水：频次治理的数据源&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 触达前的硬闸门：近 30 天是否已达上限&#10;SELECT COUNT(*) AS recent_hits&#10;FROM outreach_attempt&#10;WHERE tenant_id = ? AND creator_id = ?&#10;  AND direction = &#39;out&#39;&#10;  AND sent_at &gt;= CURRENT_TIMESTAMP - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> outreach_attempt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  creator_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tenant_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- dm | email | agency | marketplace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- out | in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- sent | delivered | bounced</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- operator user id; NULL=automation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_freq (tenant_id, creator_id, sent_at),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_campaign (campaign_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) COMMENT </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'触达流水：频次治理的数据源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 触达前的硬闸门：近 30 天是否已达上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recent_hits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outreach_attempt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creator_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'out'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sent_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>写入前查询、写入后计数会存在并发竞态：两个运营同时看到「还有额度」并同时发送，实际变成 4 次。可行的解法是在事务内对 <code>(tenant_id, creator_id)</code> 加间隙锁或使用带唯一约束的日额度表——「先占额度再发送」，失败则回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触达内容与个性化\">触达内容与个性化</h2><h3 id=\"模板与变量替换\">模板与变量替换</h3><p>批量触达必须用模板，但纯模板化的私信打开率极低——达人对一眼看出是群发的消息几乎不回应。可行的折中是「模板骨架 + 必填个性化槽位」，并要求至少一个槽位引用该达人的<strong>具体内容</strong>（如最近一条视频的主题），以证明不是群发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;template_id&quot;: &quot;T-EN-INTRO-03&quot;,&#10;  &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;en&quot;,&#10;  &quot;subject&quot;: &quot;Collab idea for your {{recent_topic}} series&quot;,&#10;  &quot;body&quot;: &quot;Hi {{first_name}}, I came across your {{recent_topic}} video from {{recent_date}} — {{personal_note}}. We make {{brand_pitch}}, and I think your audience in {{target_region}} would genuinely like it. Would you be open to a paid collab? Happy to share a brief.&quot;,&#10;  &quot;required_slots&quot;: [&quot;first_name&quot;, &quot;recent_topic&quot;, &quot;recent_date&quot;, &quot;personal_note&quot;],&#10;  &quot;forbidden_phrases&quot;: [&quot;Dear influencer&quot;, &quot;mass partnership&quot;, &quot;guaranteed exposure&quot;],&#10;  &quot;max_length&quot;: 900&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"template_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T-EN-INTRO-03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"en\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"subject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Collab idea for your {{recent_topic}} series\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hi {{first_name}}, I came across your {{recent_topic}} video from {{recent_date}} — {{personal_note}}. We make {{brand_pitch}}, and I think your audience in {{target_region}} would genuinely like it. Would you be open to a paid collab? Happy to share a brief.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required_slots\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recent_topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recent_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"personal_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"forbidden_phrases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Dear influencer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mass partnership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"guaranteed exposure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"max_length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>required_slots</code> 是发送前的校验条件：槽位缺失即拒绝发送。<code>forbidden_phrases</code> 是合规护栏——某些表述会被平台判定为垃圾信息，也会在后续披露合规审查中被引用（见第 3 章 <a href=\"../content-review-rights/disclosure-ad-compliance\">广告披露与平台合规标识</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"本地化不只是翻译\">本地化不只是翻译</h3><p>跨境建联的本地化至少要处理三层：语言（并非所有达人都用英语，拉美市场西语、葡萄牙语更有效）、商务礼节（称呼、直接程度、报价文化差异巨大）、时间（送达时间应落在达人所在时区的工作时段）。</p>\n<p>本地化不能只靠机器翻译，但也不需要为每种语言重写模板——可行做法是把模板拆成「结构 + 语言包」，结构（段落顺序、槽位位置）各语言共用，语言包按 locale 维护并经过母语者校对。瑞士、比利时这类多语国家还有一层：达人的内容语言与所在国官方语言可能不一致，模板 locale 应当取自达人的内容语言（第 1 篇主数据里的 <code>primary_lang</code>）而非地区码。</p>\n<p>送达时间可以用一个简单规则切入：按达人 <code>primary_region</code> 折算当地时间，只在其 09:00–18:00 之间投递，否则入队等待。这条规则本身不复杂，但如果漏掉，会给亚太团队发出大量「凌晨三点的私信」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回复处理与自动化的边界\">回复处理与自动化的边界</h2><h3 id=\"意图分类与路由\">意图分类与路由</h3><p>达人回复后，系统需要先分类意图再路由。典型类别有：明确有兴趣、询价、询问细节、明确拒绝、无关回复（自动回复、机器人）。</p>\n<p>分类可以用规则加模型的两级方式：先用规则匹配强信号（如「not interested」「no thanks」），未命中再走模型。分类结果决定路由：有兴趣与询价进入人工谈判队列；拒绝进入静默期；无关回复重新入队等待下一轮。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动化能做与不能做的分界\">自动化能做与不能做的分界</h3><p>这是本工作流最重要的设计决策。可以自动化的：入队排序、频次校验、模板填充、送达时间调度、回复意图分类、超时推进状态。<strong>不能</strong>自动化的：首次对外发送、报价与承诺、合同条款变更、解除静默期。</p>\n<p>判断依据是可逆性与对外性：任何一个<strong>对外发出且不可撤回</strong>的动作，都需要人工闸门。自动发送一份错误报价给 2000 个达人，事后无法收回。因此自动化流程应止步于「准备好待发队列」，由运营一次性审阅后批量确认——这既保留了规模化，也保留了人的判断点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"招募状态机的实现要点\">招募状态机的实现要点</h2><h3 id=\"超时与推进\">超时与推进</h3><p>状态机必须有明确的超时规则，否则记录会永久停在 <code>contacted</code>。基线规则：首触后 7 天无回复转 <code>no_response</code>；跟进后 7 天无回复转 <code>closed_lost</code>；谈判中 14 天无进展转 <code>closed_lost</code> 并记录原因。</p>\n<p>超时推进应由<strong>定时任务扫描</strong>实现而非依赖消息延迟队列——延迟队列在跨时区与长周期（7 天级）场景下可靠性差，且难以审计「为什么这条被推进了」。扫描式实现每轮读取「状态 + 最后变更时间」并批量推进，天然可重放、可审计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 超时推进：无回复 7 天进入 closed_lost&#10;UPDATE recruit_record&#10;SET status = &#39;closed_lost&#39;,&#10;    close_reason = &#39;no_reply_after_followup&#39;,&#10;    updated_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;WHERE status = &#39;followup&#39;&#10;  AND last_inbound_at IS NULL&#10;  AND last_outbound_at &lt; CURRENT_TIMESTAMP - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 超时推进：无回复 7 天进入 closed_lost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closed_lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    close_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'no_reply_after_followup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'followup'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_inbound_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_outbound_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"撞单防护\">撞单防护</h3><p>撞单（同一达人被多个运营联系）在并发量上来后必然发生。防护靠两层：一是数据库唯一约束——活跃状态下的 <code>(tenant_id, creator_id)</code> 只允许一条记录；二是显式的「认领」动作，运营必须先认领才能操作，认领有时效（如 48 小时无动作自动释放）。</p>\n<p>唯一约束的写法要小心：不能在 <code>(tenant_id, creator_id)</code> 上做全局唯一，因为合作结束后可能再次建联（复购）。正确的做法是用部分索引锁定活跃状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_active_recruit&#10;  ON recruit_record (tenant_id, creator_id)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;queued&#39;,&#39;contacted&#39;,&#39;replied&#39;,&#39;negotiating&#39;,&#39;agreement_pending&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uk_active_recruit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recruit_record (tenant_id, creator_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'queued'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'contacted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'replied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'negotiating'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'agreement_pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条部分唯一索引是本章最关键的一行 DDL：它把「一个达人在一个租户下不能同时有两个进行中的招募」从流程约定变成了数据库不变量，任何并发写入都无法绕过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>招募建联是多轮多渠道的状态机，不是一次邮件发送。</li>\n<li>频次治理三要素：30 天上限、72 小时冷却、拒绝后静默期；作用域是「达人 + 租户」以防跨品牌骚扰。</li>\n<li>模板必须带必填个性化槽位与禁用短语，发送前校验。</li>\n<li>本地化要覆盖语言、商务礼节、时区三段；送达时间按达人当地时间窗口。</li>\n<li>自动化止步于「待发队列」——一切对外且不可撤回的动作都要人工闸门。</li>\n<li>超时推进用定时扫描而非延迟队列，可重放可审计。</li>\n<li>活跃态唯一索引把防撞单变成数据库不变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>招募谈成后，条款需要固化：<a href=\"sample-seeding-contract\">寄样与合同/合规条款</a> 处理样品与契约，<a href=\"content-brief-deliverable\">内容 brief 与交付物约定</a> 把契约翻译成可验收的交付清单。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"招募建联工作流","id":"招募建联工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"触达渠道与频次治理","id":"触达渠道与频次治理"},{"level":3,"text":"渠道选择与优先级","id":"渠道选择与优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"频次上限与冷却期","id":"频次上限与冷却期"},{"level":2,"text":"触达内容与个性化","id":"触达内容与个性化"},{"level":3,"text":"模板与变量替换","id":"模板与变量替换"},{"level":3,"text":"本地化不只是翻译","id":"本地化不只是翻译"},{"level":2,"text":"回复处理与自动化的边界","id":"回复处理与自动化的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"意图分类与路由","id":"意图分类与路由"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化能做与不能做的分界","id":"自动化能做与不能做的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"招募状态机的实现要点","id":"招募状态机的实现要点"},{"level":3,"text":"超时与推进","id":"超时与推进"},{"level":3,"text":"撞单防护","id":"撞单防护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"达人分层与水军/刷量信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/creator-discovery-profile/creator-tier-fraud-signal"},"next":{"title":"寄样与合同/合规条款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/outreach-brief-contract/sample-seeding-contract"}}